```python
def mention(note):
    if note < 10:
        return "refusé"
    if note < 12:
        return "bien"
    return "très bien"
```

failures.expected:
```python
def mention(note):
    if note < 10:
        return "refusé"
    if note < 12:
        return "passable"
    if note < 16:
        return "bien"
    return "très bien"
```
La fonction `mention` renvoie "refusé" si note < 10, "passable" si note < 12, "bien" si note < 16, sinon "très bien".

